<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>How Agri-Fi Works</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 0;">
    <tr><td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;">
        <tr><td style="font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#166534;padding-bottom:16px;">Agri-Fi</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:12px;">Hi {{userName}}, here's how it works 📋</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Investing in agricultural trade has never been this transparent. Here's the simple 5-step process:</p>

          <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;width:32px;font-size:20px;">1️⃣</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;"><strong>Trader creates a deal</strong><br/>A verified trader lists a shipment — say, 10 tonnes of cocoa from Ghana.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;font-size:20px;">2️⃣</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;"><strong>Tokens are issued</strong><br/>The platform mints Trade_Tokens on the Stellar blockchain — each token represents $100 of the deal.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;font-size:20px;">3️⃣</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;"><strong>You invest</strong><br/>Buy tokens to fund the deal. Your money is held in a secure Stellar escrow account.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;font-size:20px;">4️⃣</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;vertical-align:top;"><strong>Track milestones</strong><br/>Watch shipment progress on-chain: Farm → Warehouse → Port → Importer.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:10px 0;vertical-align:top;font-size:20px;">5️⃣</td>
              <td style="padding:10px 0 10px 12px;vertical-align:top;"><strong>Get paid</strong><br/>Once the Importer milestone is confirmed, escrow releases automatically — you receive your share plus returns.</td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <p style="margin:20px 0;">
            <a href="{{appUrl}}/marketplace" style="display:inline-block;background:#16a34a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:bold;">Find a Deal to Fund</a>
          </p>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
          <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">{{companyName}} &middot; {{physicalAddress}}</p>
          <p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:11px;">Unsubscribe from these emails</a></p>
        </td></tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
